---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Tools"
	description="Tools built for minds that work different"
	pubDate={new Date()}
>
	<p>We don't just write about productivity for divergent minds. We build tools that actually work.</p>

	<h2>FlowFrame</h2>
	<p><strong>A dashboard for chaotic minds.</strong></p>
	<p>
		Most dashboards assume you want to see everything. FlowFrame shows you what matters <em>right now</em>. 
		Calendar events, focus timer, system status—glanceable, beautiful, built for brains that experience 
		time as "now" and "not now."
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>One-time purchase. No subscriptions.</li>
		<li>macOS native. Fast and private.</li>
		<li>Syncs with your existing tools.</li>
	</ul>
	<p><a href="https://flowframe.app">Learn more →</a></p>

	<hr />

	<h2>Managed AI Agent</h2>
	<p><strong>Your own AI assistant, actually private.</strong></p>
	<p>
		ChatGPT is convenient, but your data lives on their servers forever. Our managed agent service 
		gives you a personal AI with American engineering and European data protection. Swiss encryption. 
		Your conversations stay yours.
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Private by default. Your data never trains models.</li>
		<li>Hosted in EU (Hetzner). Swiss encryption (Proton).</li>
		<li>Works with your tools and workflows.</li>
	</ul>
	<p><em>Coming soon. Join the waitlist.</em></p>

	<hr />

	<h2>More Coming</h2>
	<p>
		We're building a suite of tools for minds that work different. 
		Each one designed around how we actually think, not how productivity gurus say we should.
	</p>
	<p>
		Want to know when we launch something new? Follow us on <a href="https://twitter.com/cognitiveelite">Twitter</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>

<style>
	h2 {
		margin-top: 2em;
		color: var(--accent);
	}
	ul {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
	}
	ul li {
		padding: 0.5em 0;
		padding-left: 1.5em;
		position: relative;
	}
	ul li::before {
		content: "→";
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		color: var(--accent);
	}
</style>
